## Codebase Discoveries
The module follows planner with Cobra v1.10.2 and yaml.v3 v3.0.1, without x/term. Project URLs eliminate project or workspace discovery calls. The CLI sends one POST /tasks?opt_fields=permalink_url, assigns me, and does not retry or follow redirects. HTTP and token commands have 30-second timeouts. The token command runs without a shell and its captured stdout is not printed on failure. Asana success responses that cannot be read or lack a permalink are treated as ambiguous outcomes so users check for an existing task before retrying. Cancellation of a description read returns promptly; an in-process caller that keeps running should release its input reader, as the pipe test does.

